    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22595" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γοητ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόης</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>skilled in witchcraft,
				juggling</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ γ. μαγεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					36
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					4.51
				</span></i>
			:—pecul. fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γοῆτις</span></b> 
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μορφή</span>”
				<i>bewitching,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					AP
					12.192
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Strat.
			</span></i>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γοητός</span></b>  (sic) is
				prob.f.l.for foreg.in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHib.</u>
				52.18
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>.</div>
